<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Central Bank offers 91-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Philippine Central Bank offers 91-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Wednesday it was offering 91-day special series Treasury bills at a rate of 10.2 percent.</p>
<p>Dealers said the rate of the new offer was in line with the rate of the benchmark 91-day treasury bill rate at Monday's auction of the Bureau of Treasury.</p>
<p>The rate of the 91-day T-bill rose to 10.392 percent on Monday from the previous 10.107 percent.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
